OL,3,CWoman arrested after four people are
OL,4,Cstabbed in Covent Garden
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested after four
OL,7,Fmen were stabbed in Covent Garden in
OL,8,Fcentral London, police said.
OL,10,FFour people have been taken to a major
OL,11,Ftrauma centre following the incident
OL,12,Fon Endell Street on Wednesday
OL,13,Fafternoon.
OL,15,FThe Metropolitan Police said four men,
OL,16,Faged 34, 39, 42, and 52 were found
OL,17,Fwith stab wounds.
OL,19,FNo further update has been given on
OL,20,Fthe extent of their injuries.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
