OL,3,CWoman arrested after four people are
OL,4,Cstabbed in Covent Garden
OL,6,FA 47-year-old woman was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of possession of an
OL,8,Foffensive weapon and assault, the
OL,9,Fforce added.
OL,11,FShe was taken to custody where she
OL,12,Fremains.
OL,14,FA London Ambulance Service
OL,15,FSpokesperson said: "We sent an
OL,16,Fambulance crew, a paramedic in a fast
OL,17,Fresponse car and an incident response
OL,18,Fofficer. We also dispatched London's
OL,19,FAir Ambulance.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
