OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786038506
OL,3,CWoman arrested after four people are
OL,4,Cstabbed in Covent Garden
OL,6,F"We treated four patients at the scene
OL,7,Fand took them all to a major trauma
OL,8,Fcentre as a priority by road".
OL,10,FThe Met Police added: A Met Police
OL,11,Fspokesperson added: "At around
OL,12,F12:27hrs on Wednesday, 5 August,
OL,13,Fpolice were called to reports of
OL,14,Fstabbing on Endell Street, Covent
OL,15,FGarden.
OL,17,F"Officers attended alongside the
OL,18,FLondon Ambulance Service and London's
OL,19,FAir Ambulance.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
