CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786038506
OL,3,CWoman arrested after four people are
OL,4,Cstabbed in Covent Garden
OL,6,F"Four men ` aged 34, 39, 42 and 52 -
OL,7,Fwere found with stab wounds and
OL,8,Fassessed at the scene by paramedics.
OL,9,FThey have since been taken to hospital
OL,10,Fand we await an update on their
OL,11,Finjuries.
OL,13,F"A 47-year-old woman was arrested on
OL,14,Fsuspicion of possession of an
OL,15,Foffensive weapon and assault. She was
OL,16,Ftaken to custody where she remains.
OL,18,F"Police remain in the area, with a
OL,19,Fscene in place on Endell Street and
OL,20,Fthe surrounding areas in Covent Garden.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/5
